    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.poster.avif?t=1751978560\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.webm?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.mp4?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crash Diet Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat big</strong>, <strong>dodge bombs</strong>, and break the system in <strong><i>Crash Diet Simulator</i></strong> \u2014 a fast-paced arcade game where <strong>chaos grows with your waistline</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Munch burgers</strong> and <strong>donuts</strong> to score points and level up your size. <strong>Reach 1000 lbs</strong> to trigger a fake crash ending... <strong>if you survive</strong> the falling food frenzy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out:</strong> Bombs slash your score in half. Grab upgrades to slow bombs, double points, or even eat explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Regular Rounds</strong> \u2013 Classic dodge-and-chomp mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Red Barrage</strong> \u2013 Bombs rain harder, but food scores double.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Sugar High</strong> \u2013 High-speed dessert-only rounds with max chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.poster.avif?t=1751978560\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.webm?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.mp4?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>No two runs are the same</strong> \u2014 food spawns, upgrades, and chaos vary every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Steam Deck Verified and offline-ready</strong> \u2014 perfect for pick-up-and-play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>No saving, no grinding</strong> \u2014 just instant arcade gratification with a twisted sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to binge</strong> and <strong>blow it all up</strong>? Let the <strong>feast</strong> begin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.poster.avif?t=1751978560\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.webm?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/abc9b9f9bc0460252b19b46375e4a89c.mp4?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crash Diet Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat big</strong>, <strong>dodge bombs</strong>, and break the system in <strong><i>Crash Diet Simulator</i></strong> \u2014 a fast-paced arcade game where <strong>chaos grows with your waistline</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Munch burgers</strong> and <strong>donuts</strong> to score points and level up your size. <strong>Reach 1000 lbs</strong> to trigger a fake crash ending... <strong>if you survive</strong> the falling food frenzy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out:</strong> Bombs slash your score in half. Grab upgrades to slow bombs, double points, or even eat explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Regular Rounds</strong> \u2013 Classic dodge-and-chomp mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Red Barrage</strong> \u2013 Bombs rain harder, but food scores double.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Sugar High</strong> \u2013 High-speed dessert-only rounds with max chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.poster.avif?t=1751978560\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.webm?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436830/extras/8a703d477099f7be5aa609206f40e003.mp4?t=1751978560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>No two runs are the same</strong> \u2014 food spawns, upgrades, and chaos vary every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Steam Deck Verified and offline-ready</strong> \u2014 perfect for pick-up-and-play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>No saving, no grinding</strong> \u2014 just instant arcade gratification with a twisted sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to binge</strong> and <strong>blow it all up</strong>? Let the <strong>feast</strong> begin.</p>",
